#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  App Manifest Engine
#  File: app_manifest_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS manifest engine responsible for:
#      • manifest validation
#      • permission schema enforcement
#      • metadata parsing
#      • capability registration
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Manifest Validation](ca://s?q=Explain_Manifest_Validation)
#    - [Permission Schema](ca://s?q=Explain_Permission_Schema)
#    - [Capability Model](ca://s?q=Explain_Capability_Model)
#    - [Manifest Export](ca://s?q=Explain_Manifest_Export)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - validate(manifest)
#         Validates manifest against schema.
#
#    - register(manifest)
#         Registers an app manifest.
#
#    - get(app_id)
#         Retrieves manifest for an app.
#
#    - list()
#         Lists all registered manifests.
#
#    - check_permission(app_id, permission)
#         Checks if app has a permission.
#
#    - export(app_id)
#         Exports manifest as JSON packet.
#
#===============================================================================
#  MANIFEST STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "id": "app.browser",
#      "name": "Sovereign Browser",
#      "version": "1.0.0",
#      "entrypoint": "main.py",
#      "permissions": ["network", "filesystem.read"],
#      "capabilities": ["tabs", "rendering"],
#      "metadata": { "author": "ARKA" }
#    }
#
